{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_title", "source_sha256": "d47a64115f3f624666a63b623e3fa2a8df000c157fd644393f1329137a5f8d49", "ja": "ヒーローで、アイドル！", "zh": "英雄之姿的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a220cdfb06db61cbebe77d024d5ade07d29ba8f63d6ddfd75fc02a81242c399c", "ja": "センターを任されたものの、何を頑張れば\r\nいいかわからない環。仲間のアドバイスに\r\n混乱しつつも、プロデューサーの言葉で\r\n大好きなレッドとの共通点を見つけ、\r\nセンターの役割を理解する。", "zh": "环被指派为Center，却不晓得该怎么\n努力才好。虽然伙伴给的建议使她陷入混乱，\n但制作人的一席话，让她发现自己和最爱\n的红色战士之间的共通点，\n进而理解了Center的职责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1000_p", "source_sha256": "64b5026623e78098a04de8d619ae2b08a05ed69b315dfb83c882d29d942b5e00", "ja": "（環のセンター公演が終わった……。\n実に環らしい、元気いっぱいのステージだったな）", "zh": "（环的Center公演结束了……\n真是场充满环的风格且活力四射的表演呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "3b8b427b27157cd3193285c8d40cea4ddd67b4b7e49fefd014452aac9358248d", "ja": "おやぶ～ん！\nたまきのステージ、楽しかった！？", "zh": "老～大！\n环的表演，看得还开心吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1002_p", "source_sha256": "96f9c75f8267671cb10448644b008fe85a6ef63c682cbcd187948c6a677ab36c", "ja": "ああ、すごく楽しかったよ。\n環はどうだ？　楽しかったか？", "zh": "嗯，我看得非常开心喔。\n那环呢？表演得开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "338be05fd7a40116b29f3e6394bb7739124ac3b5a6fd5edbdc32b95c0ce8c217", "ja": "たまきも、楽しかった！\nあとね、お客さんの顔が、よく見えた！", "zh": "环也表演得很开心！\n还有啊，观众的表情环也看得很清楚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3e1ad239be5047d3b70fa0a40a64a70b98845b42a6c6e4f59a88ea8be0159c18", "ja": "そうか。みんな、どんな顔してた？", "zh": "这样啊，大家都是怎样的表情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "b19fe77b1ed13b6e43dfde8ec9af31bfa21b1cd01622092e552c4bbef647c595", "ja": "あのね、お客さんたち、\nすっごくニコニコだったぞ～！　くふふ♪", "zh": "就是呀，观众们\n都一直是笑咪咪的喔～！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1006_p", "source_sha256": "609009dc888b56a1ee437c6adf656e4265d6c26032f843fafe2285184f7013aa", "ja": "そうか。\nなら、環レッドのステージは大成功だな！", "zh": "这样啊，\n那表示红色战士环的表演非常成功呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "8094b413f9f466a84a7e5c1272da44436d99b65d6e780de25e60209cbe507f4d", "ja": "やったー！\nねえねえ、おやぶん。アイドルってすごいね！", "zh": "太好了──！\n欸欸，老大，偶像真的好厉害耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "9a642d1ba64419179ea3acc4975f7f38cbc12117e0b35af0bd0de0a445a6ca78", "ja": "たまきがみんなをニコニコにして、\nそれを見たたまきが、またニコニコになって……。", "zh": "环让大家笑咪咪，\n然后看见大家的欢笑后，环也会变得笑咪咪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "c4c7098c4a3c32e96231764b116c6cd583d7bb18a37da6f19f26efd3b3cfc979", "ja": "ニコニコがいっぱい、いーっぱい増えてくぞ～！\nたまき、アイドルすっごく好き！　楽しい！", "zh": "欢笑就这样持续增加了好多好多呢～！\n环非常喜欢当偶像！好开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0d026ffb29df07f33738c38bc095b5586fd9f7d72279e7b68d01eb2dd0d013a2", "ja": "うん……そうだな。\n笑顔がいっぱい増えていくのは、素敵な事だよな！", "zh": "嗯……你说的对。\n笑容变得越来越多，是一件很棒的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "eb2c29bccf0676ff0f4078ecec7b4f43a89ed2dbfac4c1d211d3f387468fc781", "ja": "環～！", "zh": "环——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "bfd2ae3f1605f1cfd274715f34372d1a8cecadb419e7bbd2d58155456f09e13f", "ja": "あっ、ひびき！　うみみ！\nみんな、おそいぞ～。", "zh": "啊，响！海美美！\n大家好慢喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "a7a74c2c3d50b0beb85ad91f7e85411293dbf44dc20650a92abd7ae0b980ea1a", "ja": "ハァ、ハァ……。\n自分たちが遅いんじゃなくて、環が早いんだぞ！", "zh": "呼，呼……\n不是我们太慢，是环太快喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "715639e6e0ca5ce1bf8f5ecb3d5baeabb3518a5a6f125aadaf6a916b974ac9bb", "ja": "ハァ、ハァ……環、元気だよね！\n私も体力には自信があるほうなんだけどなーっ。", "zh": "呼，呼……环还真是有活力呢！\n虽然我对自己的体力也挺有自信的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1c2b584e68630161a84a0cb571737373e7add8e5eaa15597f98946d0ef9590a5", "ja": "響、海美、お疲れさま。\n歌織さんと育も。", "zh": "响、海美，辛苦了。\n还有歌织小姐跟育也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1018_052kao", "source_sha256": "7031a510b6efea60be5e2d3c646b9c28c9153b9b8f481b1e2c3dee1a41096fce", "ja": "お疲れさまでした。環ちゃんの、はじけるような\n元気いっぱいの歌声が、会場中に響いて……♪", "zh": "您辛苦了。\n小环洋溢着奔放活力的歌声，响彻了整个会场……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "a9349c8a2ffc7c2208cc023fcee16da53fe21345512ae239249944ebba6a3608", "ja": "うん！　環ちゃんの声、すっごくひびいてたよ！\n一番後ろのお客さんまで聞こえたと思うな♪", "zh": "没错！小环的歌声非常嘹亮喔！\n我想应该连最后面的观众也听到了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1020_052kao", "source_sha256": "708a495f72e761d5ce42119366ff20ba6fea540e30e5eeb2790630b8e88360fa", "ja": "ええ、そうね。\nレッスンの時より、ずっと大きく声が出せていたわ。", "zh": "对啊，真的是这样。\n歌声比练习的时候还要宏亮许多喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "2da12123cdd12f907c52f45aac869c27ea109bbc09d11e7b03f29174ceef1c0b", "ja": "ほんと！？　……あっ、そうだ！\nたまき、かおりにプレゼントがあるんだった！", "zh": "真的吗！？……啊，对了！\n环有礼物要送给歌织！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "3603466d8ac745a6c448b14538b04918899ca9598829b10d2efed7131d872753", "ja": "プレゼント……私に？", "zh": "有礼物……要送我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1023_p", "source_sha256": "4b7af52b1af9b35e7b9d2e0002c8fdabbfb2c20070bd559b6c8d7661f6e1bee4", "ja": "あっ。", "zh": "啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "c8e6bd39a14d2e3724eec2ecd6c9420b63d0de0f6a2f88ca6dc5d3775f25bda8", "ja": "環は、歌のレッスンのお礼に、\n歌織にプレゼントがしたいんだって！", "zh": "环说为了谢谢歌织教她唱歌，\n要送礼物给歌织！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "d850beb355886e769846d7fbbd82f4694d39bf62ea300454e906f300f4ee5ebc", "ja": "プレゼントは何がいいかって、\n私たちが相談を受けてたんだよ。ね、環♪", "zh": "她还找我们商量该送什么礼物给你才好呢。\n对吧，环♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1026_052kao", "source_sha256": "65db59eb66cd8203a3ebcc9a45155e03b7213c25b4bfeeca696096b7ee1a5cd7", "ja": "まあ、そうだったの？\n……ありがとう、環ちゃん！", "zh": "哎呀，是这样吗？\n……谢谢你，小环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1027_052kao", "source_sha256": "544c44497aa6fc6e4a24dee4480f3de15f930cdbc35bf0ca4c7c68fccad8130d", "ja": "でも、本当に気にしなくていいのよ？\nその気持ちだけで、私は十分……。", "zh": "不过，你真的不必多礼喔，\n我明白你有这份心就足够了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1028_040tam", "source_sha256": "f6e3c46a525618a7f20c8b8aee9b0be25de28344a3fe8ddcf5f53c6595b20958", "ja": "えっとね、たまきここに……。", "zh": "那个啊，环在这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1029_se", "source_sha256": "695c94a451159d976ae2b3fb3b5f2764655ee522928b1514ecb97f826a361639", "ja": "ブウン……。", "zh": "咘嗡……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1030_040tam", "source_sha256": "2766045f67576c1cda8ea0cdcc7b392bef61989ba69b3b99fb19e544f8bdc69e", "ja": "あっ！？\n逃げちゃった！", "zh": "啊！？\n逃走了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1031_052kao", "source_sha256": "8dc100d63770900f721310ff5b008fc1e1a0f4c122a5ad207ef093c70b51203f", "ja": "え？　今、飛んでいったのは……？", "zh": "咦？刚才飞走的是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "c06076c44a99ad54cd0aab9e30f4b1edfbf82f65870a8db5c612e1be8e82130d", "ja": "ミヤマクワガタ……かっこいいから、\nかおりにあげようと思ったのに……。", "zh": "高砂深山锹形虫……因为很帅气，\n所以环打算送给歌织的说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_033_1033_052kao", "source_sha256": "e2bf57380297d3de761182414fffd208f1f1206d5b80310f16aae7051b5376ff", "ja": "く、クワガタ……。", "zh": "锹、锹形虫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
